			"text":"## **By 1 January 2027**\n### 🏗 Build\n- [ ] Ship 2 products. [[1layerx.com]], [[Share Extension]] \n- [ ] Reach 100+ active users across my products. [[1layerx.com]], [[Share Extension]], [[Curious Geeks]]\n### 💰 Business\n- [ ] Acquire 3 paying customers. [[1layerx.com]]\n### 💼 Career\n- [ ] Maintain a Feature Adoption Index of ≥80% across all features I own. [[Sparrowcrm]]\n### 🌍 Reputation\n  - [ ] Publish 25 high-quality public artifacts showcasing my product thinking (case studies, teardowns, PRDs, prototypes, technical write-ups, and YouTube videos). [[Curious Geeks]]\n### 🧠 Foundation\n- [ ] Keep IITM BS on track with a CGPA above 8. [[Foundational IITM]]",
